    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d931">

                <pb facs="0998" n="712" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg712"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/4231</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Shea</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-11-11T16:00:00-04:42">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 11, 1916, 4 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 6 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your November 10, 2 p. m. I am reliably informed that no submarines have been
                    contracted for by Chile in Great Britain; two battleships, several destroyers,
                    and one or more tugs only.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shea</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
